' v1.2's end of the game when every human is out (`WaitScene.OnUpdate`
' counts the human clients only). Run with `preset classic ai amiga seed 41`:
' the one human starts in Death Town, gas 95, unprotected, and dies at the
' first day's end (as in `v12_hazard`). After his death film the start
